OL,3,AAverage five-year mortgage rate hits 6%
OL,4,Afor first time in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average interest rate on a new
OL,7,Ffive-year fixed mortgage deal has hit
OL,8,F6% for the first time in three years,
OL,9,Ffigures show.
OL,11,FThe cost of home loans has been rising
OL,12,Fin recent weeks, as lenders face higher
OL,13,Fcosts amid international concern over
OL,14,Frising prices, interest rates, and
OL,15,Fgovernment borrowing costs.
OL,17,FIt means home buyers and anyone
OL,18,Frenewing a fixed deal have seen about
OL,19,F1,500 mortgage deals priced below 5%
OL,20,Fvanish since the start of September,
OL,21,Faccording to the financial information
OL,22,Fservice Moneyfacts.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
