OL,3,AAverage five-year mortgage rate hits 6%
OL,4,Afor first time in three years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt described the situation as "brutal"
OL,7,Ffor borrowers, with the average rate on
OL,8,Ffive-year deals now at 6%, and at 5.98%
OL,9,Fon two-year fixed mortgages.
